# Delar — Architecture Reference
> Read this file before touching any code. Every decision here is intentional.

---

## What Delar Is

A decentralized digital product marketplace on Sui. Creators upload encrypted files to Walrus. Buyers pay USDC on-chain and receive a soulbound NFT that unlocks decryption via Seal. No central server. No chargebacks. No deplatforming.

---

## Stack

| Layer | Technology | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Blockchain | Sui (Move 2024) | Settlement, ownership, state |
| Storage | Walrus | Encrypted blob storage |
| Access Control | Seal (IBE threshold encryption) | Content decryption gating |
| Frontend | React.js | UI only — reads chain directly |
| RPC | Tatum (`https://sui-testnet.gateway.tatum.io`) | Sui node access |
| Payments | USDC (generic type T for testnet) | Settlement currency |

