## The Purchase PTB — Atomic Execution

Everything in `buy()` is one atomic transaction:

```
pay USDC
  → split: fee_amount → protocol
  → split: affiliate_amount → affiliate (if referral link used)
  → remainder → creator
  → increment product.total_sales
  → mint PurchaseReceipt to buyer
  → emit PurchaseCompleted event
```

If any step fails, the entire transaction reverts. No partial state.

