## Module Dependency Graph

```
checkout.move
  ├── uses → fee.move        (calculate_fee, fee_recipient)
  ├── uses → product.move    (is_active, price_usdc, increment_sales)
  └── uses → receipt.move    (mint_receipt)

seal_access.move
  └── uses → receipt.move    (buyer, product_id)

fee.move        — no dependencies
product.move    — no dependencies
receipt.move    — no dependencies
```

`mint_receipt` and `increment_sales` are `public(package)` — only `checkout.move`
can call them. External packages cannot.

