## Critical Rules — Do Not Break These

```
✗ Never add `store` ability to PurchaseReceipt
✗ Never make ProductListing a shared object
✗ Never store seal_policy_id as a field — it is derived, not stored
✗ Never use tx_context::epoch for timestamps — use clock::timestamp_ms(clock)
✗ Never hardcode a coin type — use generic T
✗ Never put decryption logic server-side — all decryption is client-side in browser
✗ Never submit the seal_approve transaction on-chain — onlyTransactionKind only
```

