## Seal Client Initialisation (TypeScript)

```typescript
const sealClient = new SealClient({
  suiClient,
  serverConfigs: [
    { objectId: process.env.REACT_APP_SEAL_KEY_SERVER_1, weight: 1 },
    { objectId: process.env.REACT_APP_SEAL_KEY_SERVER_2, weight: 1 },
  ],
  verifyKeyServers: false,
})
```

Threshold is 2 — both key servers must return shards for decryption to succeed.

